# Darshan-specific ignores. The workspace-level /.gitignore already covers
# generic JS/Rust patterns (node_modules, dist, .astro, .vite, target, env
# files, OS junk, editor noise, model weights, coverage). This file only
# layers on what's unique to darshan or what we want to keep even if
# darshan ever moves out of the yolo workspace.

# Built WASM artifact — produced by `bun run build:wasm` from the Rust crate
# in packages/inference-core-wasm/. Regenerate locally; do not commit.
apps/*/public/wasm/*.wasm

# Tesseract.js worker / language data, if it ever spills to disk
# (normally it goes to IndexedDB; this is a safety net).
apps/*/public/tessdata/
**/tesseract-*.wasm

# Lockfiles for package managers we don't use — bun.lock is checked in;
# stray npm/yarn/pnpm copies are not.
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml
